    <!-- ================================ Fire module ================================ -->
    <string name="step_fire_detect_alarm_prompt">You smell smoke and see flames near the belt drive. What do you do first?</string>
    <string name="step_fire_detect_alarm_remedy">Raise the alarm first, always. Every second of delay is a second nobody else knows.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_pick_extinguisher_prompt">The fire is in an electrical panel. Which extinguisher do you take?</string>
    <string name="step_fire_pick_extinguisher_remedy">Carbon dioxide for electrical fires. Water or foam on a live panel will conduct back to you.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_extinguisher_sequence_prompt">Put the four extinguisher steps in order.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_extinguisher_sequence_remedy">Pull, Aim, Squeeze, Sweep. Aim at the base of the flames, not the smoke.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_locate_exit_prompt">Smoke is filling the roadway. Point at the way out.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_locate_exit_remedy">Take the marked primary route. Never a lift, never a store room, never a route you have not checked is clear.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_movement_posture_prompt">The smoke is at head height. How do you move?</string>
    <string name="step_fire_movement_posture_remedy">Stay low and crawl. Clean air sits near the floor; heat and fumes rise.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_door_action_prompt">You pass through a door on your way out. What do you do with it?</string>
    <string name="step_fire_door_action_remedy">Close it behind you. A closed door slows the fire and the smoke for everybody behind you.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_assembly_point_prompt">You are outside. Look at the assembly point and hold your view on it.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_assembly_point_remedy">Go to the marked assembly point and stay there. A headcount only works if nobody wanders off.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_headcount_prompt">At the assembly point, what must happen? Choose everything that applies.</string>
    <string name="step_fire_headcount_remedy">Report to the marshal and report anyone missing. Never go back in for belongings.</string>

