    <!-- ================================ Gas and confined space ================================ -->
    <string name="step_gas_recognise_zone_prompt">Point at the confined space you must not enter without a permit.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_recognise_zone_remedy">The marked gas zone. A walkway, a ladder or a toolbox is not a confined space; the marker is what tells you.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_first_action_prompt">Your detector alarms for methane. What do you do first?</string>
    <string name="step_gas_first_action_remedy">Withdraw and raise the alarm. Do not investigate, and do not switch anything on or off.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_ppe_select_prompt">You are entering a confined space. Choose everything you need.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_ppe_select_remedy">Breathing apparatus, gas detector and harness with lifeline. A dust mask does nothing about gas.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_entry_sequence_prompt">Put the confined space entry steps in order.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_entry_sequence_remedy">Permit, isolate, ventilate, test the atmosphere, station an attendant, then enter. Never reorder these.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_contact_interval_prompt">How often must the attendant and the entrant confirm contact?</string>
    <string name="step_gas_contact_interval_remedy">Continuously. If contact breaks, the entry stops.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_rescue_decision_prompt">Your workmate collapses inside. What do you do?</string>
    <string name="step_gas_rescue_decision_remedy">Signal the alarm and call the rescue team. Most confined space deaths are the would-be rescuer.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_ventilation_check_prompt">Find the ventilation fan and hold your view on it.</string>
    <string name="step_gas_ventilation_check_remedy">Confirm the fan is actually running before you rely on it. A fan that is switched off looks the same as one that is on.</string>
    <string name="step_buddy_periodic_check_prompt">Your buddy is asking if you are alright. Answer.</string>
    <string name="step_buddy_periodic_check_remedy">Answer every check immediately. Silence is treated as an emergency, and it should be.</string>
    <string name="step_buddy_distress_response_prompt">Your buddy has stopped responding. What do you do?</string>
    <string name="step_buddy_distress_response_remedy">Raise the alarm and pull the lifeline from outside. Do not enter.</string>

