    <!-- ================================ Machinery lockout ================================ -->
    <string name="step_loto_identify_hazard_prompt">Point at the part of this machine that will take your hand off.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_identify_hazard_remedy">The nip point, where two moving parts meet. That is what the guard is there for.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_sequence_prompt">Put the lockout steps in order.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_sequence_remedy">Notify, shut down, isolate, lock, dissipate stored energy, verify zero energy. Verifying is the step people skip.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_key_control_prompt">Who holds the key to your lock?</string>
    <string name="step_loto_key_control_remedy">Each worker fits their own lock and keeps their own key. Nobody can free you but you.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_conveyor_jam_prompt">A conveyor has jammed. What do you do?</string>
    <string name="step_loto_conveyor_jam_remedy">Stop it, isolate it, lock it, then clear the jam. Never reach into a running belt.</string>
    <string name="step_loto_guard_missing_prompt">The guard on a machine is missing. What do you do?</string>
    <string name="step_loto_guard_missing_remedy">Stop and report it. A machine without its guard does not run, whatever the shift target is.</string>

